8a4-4c4d-9197-231764dcb7b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3c3eab27-e8a4-4c4d-9197-231764dcb7b0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Manser_Biggs\" title=\"Manser Biggs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png/25px-Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png/38px-Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png/50px-Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gondian Manser Biggs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png/25px-Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Portrait_Manser_Biggs.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Manser_Biggs\" title=\"Manser Biggs\">Gondian Manser Biggs</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lanpos_Biggs\" title=\"Lanpos Biggs\">Lanpos Bigg</a>, An Elegy\n</p><p><br>\nFrom  Manser, in loving memory.\n</p><p><br>\nHow awed I was\n</p><p>By your strength, till I saw it was less than\n</p><p>Your gentleness. No one\n</p><p>Exceeded your precision, your standards, but patience\n</p><p>Patience was your watchword. Patience\n</p><p>And\n</p><p>Love.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201950\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1924/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31182/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7385/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936303/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.645      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.645      1 -total\n 54.52%   27.068      8 Template:Icon_text\n 47.79%   23.725     19 Template:Trim\n 21.04%   10.444      2 Template:Uid\n 15.51%    7.698      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.53%    7.214      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.59%    5.753      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.86%    5.391      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.79%    5.359      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30797-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201950 and revision id 363548. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}